ption":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3002280,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD!</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/87a4c2f4a804089caef5cc3441abe592.poster.avif?t=1769192503\" width=618 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/87a4c2f4a804089caef5cc3441abe592.webm?t=1769192503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/87a4c2f4a804089caef5cc3441abe592.mp4?t=1769192503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave everything behind and open a tiny bookshop by the sea in this <strong>cozy narrative management game</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock your <strong>Tiny Bookshop</strong> with different books and items, set up shop in scenic locations, and run your cozy second-hand bookshop while getting to know the locals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/76c3c6833bfb816a3d2e0797ccb9a331.webp?t=1769192503\" width=616 height=59 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/723c51c0a66d25434354233df84ee922.poster.avif?t=1769192503\" width=618 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/723c51c0a66d25434354233df84ee922.webm?t=1769192503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/723c51c0a66d25434354233df84ee922.mp4?t=1769192503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate</strong> your Tiny Bookshop with the <strong>items</strong> you collect. Are you into absolutely plastering it with plants? Maybe a spooky candle-lit atmosphere is more your style? Every item also has an effect on your customers and can introduce new mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/3bfb7fb0795d3adcecfced6f76648fda.poster.avif?t=1769192503\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/3bfb7fb0795d3adcecfced6f76648fda.webm?t=1769192503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/3bfb7fb0795d3adcecfced6f76648fda.mp4?t=1769192503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recommend</strong> the right <strong>book</strong> to the right person ~ or try to expand their literary horizon? Sometimes they just need a little help finding a book they will love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/b9673b5ca710864f387739e2b70e9427.poster.avif?t=1769192503\" width=618 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/b9673b5ca710864f387739e2b70e9427.webm?t=1769192503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/b9673b5ca710864f387739e2b70e9427.mp4?t=1769192503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Befriend</strong> Bookstonbury's quirky cast of <strong>characters</strong> and help each other out! They're friendly, promise :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/dd2d1bc4453837e46a447c3fe7bcb38b.poster.avif?t=1769192503\" width=618 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/dd2d1bc4453837e46a447c3fe7bcb38b.webm?t=1769192503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/dd2d1bc4453837e46a447c3fe7bcb38b.mp4?t=1769192503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stock</strong> books of different genres to satisfy the locals\u2019 <strong>reading habits</strong> and watch your customers trickle in. Every place around town attracts a slightly different crowd, so get to know your audience and become a master bookseller!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/0e6131677ff3412985a93c81925ab34e.poster.avif?t=1769192503\" width=618 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/0e6131677ff3412985a93c81925ab34e.webm?t=1769192503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/0e6131677ff3412985a93c81925ab34e.mp4?t=1769192503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> the scenic places of charming <strong>Bookstonbury-by-the-Sea</strong> and learn the ins and outs of the town. Discover its long history ~ what happened at Bookston Burgh? And who really was St. Bookston?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/acef5a12c542f231cc21cf917e1b8163.poster.avif?t=1769192503\" width=618 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/acef5a12c542f231cc21cf917e1b8163.webm?t=1769192503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2133760/extras/acef5a12c542f231cc21cf917e1b8163.mp4?t=1769192503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover secrets</strong>, collect items and grow your stamp collection as you explore the nooks and crannies of Bookstonbury. Who knows what else you'll find? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse